  <tag k="description" v="Built in 1717, this ornate vermilion gate is the last standing structure of the grand mausoleum dedicated to Tokugawa Ietsugu, the 7th Shogun. It is designated as an Important Cultural Property and is famous for the two Buddhist protector deities (Niten)."/>
